  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>What akasha that cannot heal will become a potent shield.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Radiant Dawn Style, Diplomacy 7 ranks.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you restore hit points to an ally, if this healing would raise their hit points to its maximum, they are granted temporary hit points equal to any excess healing. These temporary hit points stacks with other temporary hit points granted by you, up to a maximum of of half of the ally’s maximum hit points, and last for one minute.</p>\n<p>You gain 1 point of essence.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/rajah#toc49\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
